    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "链的组装顺序",
      "items": [
        "networkFetchSequence = 位图缓存读取 → 线程切换 → 位图缓存 → 解码 → 编码缓存 → 磁盘缓存 → 网络抓取",
        "ProducerSequenceFactory 按 SourceUriType 选链，本地文件、content、asset 各有独立序列"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "结果如何回到 UI",
      "items": [
        "ImagePipeline.submitFetchRequest 用 CloseableProducerToDataSourceAdapter 把 Producer 回调转成 DataSource",
        "AbstractDraweeController.submitRequest 订阅 DataSource，onNewResultInternal 把 image 交给 DraweeHierarchy"
      ]
    }
